            'Key Remapping (`as`) & Filtering Properties by Value Type',
            'TypeScript 4.1+ added `as NewKey` inside mapped types, allowing you to rename keys dynamically OR filter out unwanted properties completely by remapping them to `never`!',
            'This unlocks powerful helpers like `PickByType<T, number>` (keeping only numeric properties) or `Getters<T>` (`id` -> `getId`).',
